                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\ud83c\udf1f The Childhood Cancer STAR Reauthorization Act was signed into law today! \ud83c\udf1f\n\nThis will extend my STAR Act\u2014the most comprehensive bill ever written to address pediatric cancer\u2014for another 5 years, ensuring it continues to benefit young cancer patients & survivors.",
