                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today I held my 14th Annual Childhood Cancer Summit.\n\nI founded the Childhood Cancer Caucus in 2005, & it's been the highlight of my career to see these beautiful lives changed through our work.\n\nThank you to the brave patients, survivors, & advocates who made today so special. https://t.co/AS4no3Q1l7",
