                "text": "No child should have to battle cancer, especially without access to the most advanced treatments available.\n\nAs a longtime advocate for childhood cancer patients, I am proud to reintroduce the Give Kids a Chance Act to ensure every kid has a fighting chance to beat this horrific disease. \u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/M4cwzA84MT",
